WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Bluetooth Audio Codec Viewer. See the codec Windows actually negotiated.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Connect your Bluetooth audio device, then select Detect codec.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Administrator approval appears only when detection starts. A short-lived helper reads one local Bluetooth A2DP trace.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
See the codec name, output device, codec and vendor identifiers, and observation time.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
No audio recording, telemetry, advertising, driver, service, or Bluetooth settings changes.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Bluetooth Audio Codec Viewer for Windows 10 and Windows 11.

